cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "EVIDENT: A Sparse-Evidence Transformer for Intrinsically Explainable Anomaly Detection in Real-World Dynamic Graphs"
abstract: >-
  EVIDENT is an intrinsically explainable anomaly detector for dynamic graphs.
  For each event it selects a small set of past interactions as evidence and
  computes the anomaly score from that evidence alone, so the explanation is
  the exact basis of the decision.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Iyad-Assaad-Nekka/EVIDENT-Explainable-Dynamic-Graph-anomaly-Detection"
